  <article class="tp-article">

  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> the average thigh size is about <strong>24&nbsp;inches (61&ndash;62&nbsp;cm)</strong> at the upper thigh for both women and men, and about <strong>21&nbsp;inches (53&nbsp;cm)</strong> at mid-thigh (women 20.8&nbsp;in, men 21.2&nbsp;in).</p></div>

